# Every value here is public: it ends up in the static bundle.
# The price board and relayer service (bazaar-relayer-priceboard): the deployed one, or
# http://localhost:8080 for one you run yourself. .env.production sets the deployed one for builds.
VITE_SERVICE_URL=https://bazaar-relayer-priceboard.fly.dev
# JSON-RPC for read-only browsing before a wallet connects.
VITE_RPC_URL=https://sepolia-rollup.arbitrum.io/rpc
# Optional: WebSocket RPCs the page hears of each new block from, comma-separated, so trades and the book
# show within about half a second; every read still goes to VITE_RPC_URL. "none" polls instead. Unset,
# free public ones (dRPC, then PublicNode). Never one with an API key.
# VITE_RPC_WS_URLS=
# Optional: a subgraph the page queries itself when the service cannot answer history. Never one with an
# API key. Unset, the official deployment's public subgraph.
# VITE_SUBGRAPH_URL=
# Reown (WalletConnect) project ID, from dashboard.reown.com. Allowlist the app's domains there.
VITE_REOWN_PROJECT_ID=
